or Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/IgnoreResting\" title=\"Status properties/IgnoreResting\">IgnoreResting</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self_(Condition)\" title=\"Disguise Self (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disguise Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self_(Condition)\" title=\"Disguise Self (Condition)\">Disguise Self</a> prevents guards from attacking characters with this condition.</li>\n<li>This condition only upsets the faction whose guards you killed and clears when starting a new Act (Act One to Act Two or Act Two to Act Three).</li>\n<li>This condition is removed upon death, even upon a subsequent <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Revivify\" title=\"Revivify\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp/20px-Revivify_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp/30px-Revivify_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp/40px-Revivify_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Revivify\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp/20px-Revivify_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Revivify\" title=\"Revivify\">Revivify</a> or resurrection from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/38px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/50px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Withers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\">Withers</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>May permanently persist on a character in an Act where it was triggered despite no remaining \"witness\" guards.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714232512\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1843/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17255/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5783/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.032/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usag